codex
The root cause is specific: this audit sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<reported-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22’s runtime uses the latter to locate its executable, so both Lean and Lake fail before project loading. I’m applying a narrow local preload shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the trusted preflight unchanged. The shim and its test output will remain in evidence.
apply patch
