+`363d98891cb09c42f1719e3632b09413274cb5603460fa8823003da0ffba11b0`,
+also exactly matching `/audit-input.json`. Producer provenance passes; there
+is no infrastructure `AUDIT_ERROR`.
+
+Evidence:
